---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import PageHeader from "../components/PageHeader.astro";
import Icon from "../components/Icon.astro";
import ProcessSteps from "../../_section-library/content/ProcessSteps.astro";
import CTASplit from "../../_section-library/cta/CTASplit.astro";
import { siteConfig } from "../config/siteConfig";
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About Mane Talibong | Web Developer, Designer & Creative`}
  description="I'm Mane Talibong. I taught myself web development, started working at 18, and later returned to PECIT as a BSIS student and Editor in Chief of The Watch Guild. I build websites, photograph events, and help businesses grow online."
>
  <PageHeader
    title="About Me"
    subtitle="A web developer, designer, and student from Butuan City. This is the path that got me here."
    backgroundImage="/images/about/filmmaking.jpg"
    breadcrumbs={[
      { label: "Home", href: "/" },
      { label: "About" },
    ]}
  />

  <!-- Intro -->
  <section class="bg-surface py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">
        <div class="relative">
          <img
            src="/images/about/mane-portrait.jpg"
            alt="Mane Talibong, web developer, designer, and filmmaker"
            class="w-full rounded-3xl object-cover object-center aspect-[3/4] sm:aspect-[4/5]"
            loading="eager"
            decoding="async"
          />
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">Mane Talibong</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-text">
            Creative Online. Hands-On Locally.
          </h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            I'm a web developer and graphic designer with 3+ years of experience creating websites and digital experiences for businesses.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            My work combines development, design, SEO, and digital marketing so sites look professional and are built around business goals. I help local businesses get found, look established online, and turn visitors into leads.
          </p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            Aside from client work, I photograph weddings and events, served as Editor in Chief of The Watch Guild at PECIT, and work in filmmaking with local clients.
          </p>
          <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
            {[
              "Web Development",
              "Graphic Design",
              "Event Photography",
              "The Watch Guild",
              "Filmmaking",
            ].map((tag) => (
              <span class="rounded-full border border-border bg-surface-alt px-4 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-text">
                {tag}
              </span>
            ))}
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Journey -->
  <section class="bg-surface-alt py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-10 lg:gap-16 items-start">
        <figure class="order-1 lg:order-2 lg:sticky lg:top-28">
          <img
            src="/images/about/twg-pecit.png"
            alt="Mane Talibong with The Watch Guild team at PECIT, holding awards at a recognition event in Butuan City"
            class="w-full rounded-3xl"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption class="mt-4 text-sm text-text-muted">
            With The Watch Guild family at a recognition event in Butuan City.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>

        <div class="order-2 lg:order-1">
          <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">The Journey</p>
          <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-text">
            For The Version Of Me Who Felt Lost
          </h2>
          <div class="mt-5 space-y-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
            <p>
              My journey hasn't been simple, but it's something I'm proud of. Everything started when I found myself stuck and confused about where to go after graduation. I knew college wouldn't be easy, not only academically, but also financially.
            </p>
            <p>
              I first enrolled in PECIT in 2022. I made the difficult decision to drop out because I didn't want to become a financial burden to my parents. After that I tried a different path. I took the entrance exam at CSU and failed on my first attempt.
            </p>
            <p>
              Instead of doing nothing, I studied programming at home out of curiosity. I even developed my first website using only my phone. Soon after, a friend invited me to work. There I met mentors and friends who helped me grow. I worked as a web developer and designer, my dream job, and at just 18 years old, while others were thinking about where to hang out, I was already working night shifts and earning what I once only dreamed about.
            </p>
            <p>
              Despite earning well, something still felt missing.
            </p>
            <p>
              In 2023 I tried again and took the CSU entrance exam with only one hour of review, and I passed. Balancing daytime studies and nighttime work was incredibly tough. Eventually I chose to pause school again to focus on work, since I was already earning more than what many could in a day.
            </p>
            <p>
              Later I became a lead web designer, SEO specialist, and lead digital marketer at an international startup based in Texas. Even then I barely slept eight hours. My parents encouraged me to study again, and in 2024 I decided to start another chapter. I re-enrolled in PECIT as a first-year BSIS student. Thankfully they offered flexible hours for working students like me.
            </p>
            <p>
              I met amazing people and found a family in TWG who supported my growth. I also discovered new passions like photography, which opened doors to sideline work covering weddings and events.
            </p>
            <p>
              It wasn't always easy. Being a student, working nights, and serving as Editor in Chief all at once was exhausting. But it was worth it. Every stress and challenge shaped me.
            </p>
          </div>
          <blockquote class="mt-8 rounded-2xl border border-secondary/25 bg-surface p-6 sm:p-8">
            <p class="font-heading text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-text leading-snug">
              Today I dedicate this journey to my younger self: the one who once felt lost, who questioned his future, who doubted his worth, and who thought he would never afford the life he dreamed of.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              That younger version of me, who once felt small, is now part of the 1% of his dreams: buying the things he wants, paying his own tuition, and helping his parents.
            </p>
          </blockquote>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Creative work beyond websites -->
  <section class="bg-surface-alt py-16 sm:py-24 border-t border-border">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="max-w-2xl mb-12">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">More Of What I Do</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-text">
          Storytelling Beyond The Browser
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
          Digital work is the core of my practice. Photography, editorial leadership, and film keep the same focus: clear stories, strong visuals, and work that connects with real people.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        <article class="bg-surface rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/about/filmmaking.jpg"
            alt="On-location filmmaking and photography production"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/15">
              <Icon name="eye" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text">Event Photography</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              Photography started as a new passion at PECIT. It opened doors to covering weddings and events locally, capturing moments people actually want to keep.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-surface rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/about/editor-in-chief.jpg"
            alt="Mane Talibong as Editor in Chief"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover object-top"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/15">
              <Icon name="clipboard" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text">Editor in Chief, TWG</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              I served as Editor in Chief of The Watch Guild, PECIT's student publication. The team became a family that supported my growth while I studied and worked nights.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>

        <article class="bg-surface rounded-2xl overflow-hidden">
          <img
            src="/images/about/mane-portrait.jpg"
            alt="Filmmaking and camera work"
            class="w-full aspect-[4/3] object-cover object-[center_20%]"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <div class="p-6">
            <div class="mb-3 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-secondary/15">
              <Icon name="zap" class="h-5 w-5 text-primary" />
            </div>
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text">Filmmaking</h3>
            <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-text-muted leading-relaxed">
              I actively make films and compete with local clients, covering production from shoot planning to a finished visual story.
            </p>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <ProcessSteps
    eyebrow="My Approach"
    heading="How I Work With Businesses"
    description="Every website project follows a simple path focused on usability, visibility, and conversions."
    columns={4}
    steps={[
      { icon: "users", title: "Understand", description: "I learn about the business, audience, competitors, and goals." },
      { icon: "clipboard", title: "Plan", description: "A clear structure and strategy focused on usability and conversions." },
      { icon: "settings", title: "Build", description: "A responsive, fast, professional website tailored to the business." },
      { icon: "zap", title: "Optimize & Grow", description: "SEO, performance, mobile, and ongoing marketing support." },
    ]}
  />

  <!-- Skills -->
  <section class="bg-surface py-16 sm:py-24">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <p class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-secondary mb-3">Skills</p>
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-text">What I Bring To A Project</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 lg:gap-8">
        {[
          {
            title: "Web Development",
            items: ["HTML, CSS, JavaScript, PHP", "WordPress, Elementor, Divi", "WooCommerce and Shopify", "Responsive design and performance"],
          },
          {
            title: "Design",
            items: ["Graphic and brand design", "UI and landing pages", "Social media graphics", "Photoshop, Lightroom, Canva"],
          },
          {
            title: "SEO & Creative",
            items: ["Local SEO and GBP optimization", "Content and conversion work", "Event photography", "Editorial leadership and film"],
          },
        ].map((group) => (
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-border bg-surface-alt p-7">
            <h3 class="font-heading text-xl font-bold text-text mb-4">{group.title}</h3>
            <ul class="space-y-3">
              {group.items.map((item) => (
                <li class="flex items-start gap-3 text-sm text-text-muted">
                  <span class="mt-0.5 flex h-5 w-5 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-secondary/15">
                    <Icon name="check" class="h-3 w-3 text-primary" />
                  </span>
                  {item}
                </li>
              ))}
            </ul>
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <CTASplit
    headline="Have a project in mind?"
    subtitle="Website, redesign, branding, photography, or film. Tell me what you need and we'll map the next step."
    imageSrc="/images/about/editor-in-chief.jpg"
    imageAlt="Mane Talibong in the studio"
    estimateLabel="Let's Work Together"
    estimateHref="/contact/"
    callLabel={`Call ${siteConfig.phone}`}
  />
</BaseLayout>
